{"id":"659533","name":"酥炸茄盒","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"","cover":"images/659533/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肉末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"茄子","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肉末加盐、料酒、生抽、蚝油、水淀粉拌匀。","img":"images/659533/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"大茄子一个。","img":"images/659533/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切成连刀片，即两片中间不切段。","img":"images/659533/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"夹入肉馅成茄盒。","img":"images/659533/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋、面粉、淀粉、适量清水。","img":"images/659533/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"拌匀成稠面糊。","img":"images/659533/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"茄盒挂上一层面糊。","img":"images/659533/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中放油烧六成热，放入茄盒炸至金黄。","img":"images/659533/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"炸好的茄盒捞出，等油温升高，再放入锅中炸半分钟左右。","img":"images/659533/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放上吸油纸，成品外酥里嫩。","img":"images/659533/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}